      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16239/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Split French bread rolls and arrange them on a baking sheet; spread with butter. Warm in the preheated oven for 10 minutes, or until heated through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/60Ye_g7PgcYkWs7VJbNjBrh5yQ8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16239-Easy-Slow-Cooker-French-Dip-DDMFS-Step-4-0467-ad768558ea2b4d9790e3cfa79b56c926.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16239/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, remove rump roast from the slow cooker and thinly slice on the diagonal.",
